# LangFC results (derivatives) from Shain & Fedorenko (2025)

This repository contains derived parcellation data from the nearly 2,000 fMRI scanning sessions
analyzed in Shain & Fedorenko (2025). We do not have participants' consent to release the source data
because fMRI timecourses are identifiable (Finn et al., 2015).

This dataset is large (over 3TB) and currently under construction due to the time and compute needed
to upload so much data. Please check back in a few days.


